  "method": [
    "Both frozen checkouts ran sequentially with the same active venv Python, same host and identical unmodified probe. LOCALPILOT_SOURCE and PYTHONPATH were set explicitly to the checkout under test.",
    "For each size, authenticated local HTTP creates one actual scripted task. Its timestamp is moved behind synthetic history so exact lookup/status exercise an old real task, not a first-page record.",
    "Each action has one warm-up and five measured steady-state samples. SQL tracing and Python tracemalloc each use a separate additional sample and do not contaminate the timing samples.",
    "Every reported median was recomputed from the five original samples and checked for equality. Candidate traced hot paths have zero whole-task-map reads and writes.",
    "The existing probe asserts exact task_id and session_id equality and the old-task page position; it records assertion results, not the generated UUID strings. No new instrumentation was added."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Results are one local controlled comparison, not a universal latency guarantee or model-capability benchmark. The one-record candidate is not uniformly faster than baseline.",
    "Only one actual task per size uses the scripted backend; additional retained history records are synthetic. No external model API is called.",
    "Tracemalloc measures Python allocations in a separate sample, not process RSS or total machine memory.",
    "Keyset pagination still performs count(*) for total. Do not claim that all historical operations are O(1). The measured older page is the second page.",
    "Context validation still checks all records of the relevant session. Synthetic records in this probe have different session IDs, so this is not a same-session 10000-record privacy-walk benchmark.",
    "First-open duration includes migration, backup and host startup once, while action samples measure steady state after that open.",
    "Payload byte counts exclude indexes, the rest of the database, journal/WAL and backup files; migration backup file size is recorded separately.",
    "Parent coordinated the benchmark window to avoid other project-heavy jobs; this probe did not independently profile every host process."
  ],
